OL,3,GGrampian                               
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be   
OL,6,Fmostly cloudy through the evening and  
OL,7,Fovernight with showers feeding inland  
OL,8,Ffrom the east. Drier with clear spells 
OL,9,Ffurther west along the Moray coast.    
OL,11,CThursday:FA mostly cloudy day with     
OL,12,Fsome brighter intervals. A few showers 
OL,13,Faround in the morning, but these will  
OL,14,Fgradually ease in the afternoon,       
OL,15,Fleaving dry conditions. Winds becoming 
OL,16,Fstrong.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
