OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FOvernight
OL,6,Frain clearing Friday morning, then     
OL,7,Fdry. Mostly dry and cloudy on Saturday 
OL,8,Fwith light winds then rain overnight.  
OL,9,FMostly dry with bright spells on       
OL,10,FSunday.                                
